=================
 DATA DICTIONARY 
=================

FIELD NAME: ObjectID
FIELD DESCRIPTION: ESRI database generated unique identifer
CODE VALUES: Integer

FIELD NAME: Shape
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Polygon
CODE VALUES: Geometry

FIELD NAME: WRI_NUMBER
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Instrument Number
CODE VALUES:TEXT 

FIELD NAME: Name
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Instrument property name
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: AQUIFER
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Aquifer type
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: GW_AREA
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Groundwater area name
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: SUB_AREA
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Subarea name
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: DIVISION
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Surface Water Division
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: BASIN
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Basin
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: RESOURC
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Resource name
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: INSTRUMENT_TYPE
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Instrument type
CODE VALUES: TEXT

FIELD NAME: ISSUE_DATE
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Instrument issue date
CODE VALUES: Date

FIELD NAME: EXPIRY_DATE
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Instrument expiry date
CODE VALUES: Date

FIELD NAME: POSTAL_ADD
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Party postal address - Address for all official correspondence to be sent.
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: LICENCE_ALLOCATION
FIELD DESCRIPTION: The volume of water in kilolitres allocated to the party (licensee) per year.
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: ALL_PARTIES
FIELD DESCRIPTION: All licensees that are listed on the licence. 
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: LICENCE_ADDRESS
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Licence address is the description of where the water is being used.
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: SECURITY_INT
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Security interest under the Rights in Water and Irrigation Act 1914. Security interest means an interest in a licence that secures payment of a debt.         
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: CONVICT_EXIST
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Does a conviction exist under the Rights in Water and Irrigation Act 1914. Licensees (parties) that have had a conviction under the Rights in Water and Irrigation Act 1914 recorded against them.
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: AGREE_EXIST
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Does an Agreement exist under the Rights in Water and Irrigation Act 1914. An agreement between a licensee and third party allowing the use of an existing water entitlement.
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: NOTATIONS_EXIST
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Does a notation exist under the Rights in Water and Irrigation Act 1914. A notation on the register that a person has a security interest in the relevant licence.
CODE VALUES: Text

FIELD NAME: DIRECTIONS_EXIST
FIELD DESCRIPTION: Directions under the Rights in Water and Irrigation Act 1914. A Direction issued under the Rights in Water and Irrigation Act 1914 directing the licensee to cease or vary conditions under their licence for certain period of time.
CODE VALUES: Text

